SUMMARY:[Amber] Commons second reading of the Utilities (Social Tariff) Bi
 ll
DESCRIPTION:Flagged Digital. A Bill to require utility companies to provid
 e social tariffs for energy\, broadband and mobile bills to support custo
 mers who are disabled\, elderly or on a low income\; and for connected pu
 rposes. Documents published: none yet. Status: provisional. Source: UK Pa
 rliament\, Bills site\, Utilities (Social Tariff) Bill stages https://bil
 ls.parliament.uk/bills/4311/stages
URL:https://bills.parliament.uk/bills/4311/stages
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
