SUMMARY:UK and EU emissions trading schemes linked\, exempting steel and a
 luminium exports from the EU carbon border tax
DESCRIPTION:Removes the EU carbon border tax on about £6.5 billion of UK 
 exports\, including steel and aluminium\, a cost for manufacturers sellin
 g metals into the EU. Legislation is due in 2027. Status: provisional. So
 urce: Cabinet Office\, UK/EU Summit 2026 key documents (explainers)\, 20 
 November 2026 https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/ukeu-summit-2026
 -key-documents
